# not. No example before this one answers with `not`, so build's `not` case was unbuilt code.
To odd given n, answering a Bool:
  n is an Int, trusted 256 of 256.
  It never repeats.
  Make sure n is not void.
  Answer not (n modulo 2 is equal to 0).
Check: odd of 4 gives false, trusted 120.
Check: odd of 5 gives true, trusted 120.
